    "{\n",
    " \"cells\": [\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# antiSMASH 与 Prokka CDS 注释比较\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"本 Notebook 演示如何比较 antiSMASH 和 Prokka 输出的 CDS（编码序列）注释。\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## 功能特性\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"1. **提取 CDS 注释** - 从 GenBank 文件中提取所有 CDS 特征\\n\",\n",
    "    \"2. **位置比较** - 基于基因组位置匹配 CDS（允许容差）\\n\",\n",
    "    \"3. **统计分析** - 计算匹配率和差异\\n\",\n",
    "    \"4. **详细报告** - 生成可视化报告和 CSV 导出\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## 使用场景\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- 验证两个注释工具的一致性\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- 识别工具特异性的注释\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- 质量控制和结果验证\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 1. 环境准备\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 安装必要的依赖（如果尚未安装）\\n\",\n",
    "    \"!pip install -q biopython pandas openpyxl\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"from pathlib import Path\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import sys\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 导入比较工具\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from esm3_pipeline.cds_comparison import (\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    extract_cds_from_gbk,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    extract_cds_from_dir,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    compare_cds,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print_comparison_report,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    compare_annotations,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    export_comparison_to_csv\\n\",\n",
    "    \")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"✅ 模块导入成功\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 2. 指定输入文件路径\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 方法 A: 直接指定 GenBank 文件\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 示例：使用单个 GenBank 文件\\n\",\n",
    "    \"antismash_gbk = Path('esm3_pipeline/outputs/antismash_results/your_genome.gbk')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"prokka_gbk = Path('prokka_esm3_runs/run_001/prokka_output/PROKKA.gbk')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 检查文件是否存在\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if antismash_gbk.exists():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"✅ antiSMASH 文件存在: {antismash_gbk}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"⚠️  antiSMASH 文件不存在: {antismash_gbk}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if prokka_gbk.exists():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"✅ Prokka 文件存在: {prokka_gbk}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"⚠️  Prokka 文件不存在: {prokka_gbk}\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"### 方法 B: 指定输出目录（自动查找 .gbk 文件）\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 示例：使用输出目录\\n\",\n",
    "    \"antismash_dir = Path('esm3_pipeline/outputs/antismash_results')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"prokka_dir = Path('prokka_esm3_runs/run_001/prokka_output')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"antiSMASH 目录: {antismash_dir}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"Prokka 目录: {prokka_dir}\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 3. 快速比较（推荐方式）\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"使用便捷函数一步完成比较：\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 方法 A：比较单个文件\\n\",\n",
    "    \"results = compare_annotations(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    antismash_path=antismash_gbk,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    prokka_path=prokka_gbk,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    tolerance=10,  # 位置容差（碱基对）\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    verbose=True   # 显示详细报告\\n\",\n",
    "    \")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 方法 B：比较目录（推荐用于多个文件）\\n\",\n",
    "    \"results = compare_annotations(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    antismash_path=antismash_dir,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    prokka_path=prokka_dir,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    tolerance=10,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    verbose=True\\n\",\n",
    "    \")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 4. 分步比较（高级用法）\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"如果需要更多控制，可以分步执行：\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 步骤 1: 提取 CDS 注释\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"正在提取 antiSMASH CDS...\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"antismash_cds = extract_cds_from_gbk(antismash_gbk, 'antismash')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 或者从目录提取: antismash_cds = extract_cds_from_dir(antismash_dir, 'antismash')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"\\\\n正在提取 Prokka CDS...\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"prokka_cds = extract_cds_from_gbk(prokka_gbk, 'prokka')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 或者从目录提取: prokka_cds = extract_cds_from_dir(prokka_dir, 'prokka')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"\\\\n提取完成:\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"  antiSMASH: {len(antismash_cds)} 个 CDS\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"  Prokka: {len(prokka_cds)} 个 CDS\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 步骤 2: 执行比较\\n\",\n",
    "    \"results = compare_cds(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    antismash_cds=antismash_cds,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    prokka_cds=prokka_cds,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    tolerance=10  # 位置匹配容差（碱基对）\\n\",\n",
    "    \")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 步骤 3: 打印报告\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print_comparison_report(results, verbose=True)\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 5. 查看详细结果\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 查看匹配的 CDS 对（前 5 个）\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"匹配的 CDS 对示例:\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"=\\\" * 80)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"for i, (as_cds, pk_cds) in enumerate(results['matched'][:5], 1):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"\\\\n#{i}:\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"  位置: {as_cds.start}-{as_cds.end} ({as_cds.length} bp)\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"  antiSMASH: {as_cds.gene or as_cds.locus_tag} | {as_cds.product[:60]}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"  Prokka:    {pk_cds.gene or pk_cds.locus_tag} | {pk_cds.product[:60]}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    if as_cds.translation and pk_cds.translation:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        same_seq = \\\"✅ 相同\\\" if as_cds.translation == pk_cds.translation else \\\"⚠️  不同\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        print(f\\\"  蛋白序列: {same_seq}\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 查看仅在 antiSMASH 中的 CDS（前 5 个）\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if results['antismash_only']:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"\\\\n仅在 antiSMASH 中的 CDS:\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"=\\\" * 80)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    for i, cds in enumerate(results['antismash_only'][:5], 1):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        print(f\\\"#{i}: {cds.start:8d}-{cds.end:8d} ({cds.length:5d}bp) {cds.gene or cds.locus_tag:20s} {cds.product[:40]}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"\\\\n✅ 所有 antiSMASH CDS 都在 Prokka 中找到了匹配\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 查看仅在 Prokka 中的 CDS（前 5 个）\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if results['prokka_only']:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"\\\\n仅在 Prokka 中的 CDS:\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"=\\\" * 80)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    for i, cds in enumerate(results['prokka_only'][:5], 1):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        print(f\\\"#{i}: {cds.start:8d}-{cds.end:8d} ({cds.length:5d}bp) {cds.gene or cds.locus_tag:20s} {cds.product[:40]}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"\\\\n✅ 所有 Prokka CDS 都在 antiSMASH 中找到了匹配\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 6. 按记录统计\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 查看每个记录（contig/序列）的详细统计\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"按记录统计:\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"=\\\" * 80)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"{'记录ID':<30} {'antiSMASH':>10} {'Prokka':>10} {'匹配':>10} {'仅AS':>10} {'仅PK':>10}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"-\\\" * 80)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"for record_id, stats in results['record_stats'].items():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"{record_id:<30} {stats['antismash_total']:>10} {stats['prokka_total']:>10} \\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"          f\\\"{stats['matched']:>10} {stats['antismash_only']:>10} {stats['prokka_only']:>10}\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 7. 导出结果到 CSV\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 导出为 CSV 文件\\n\",\n",
    "    \"output_prefix = Path('test_output/cds_comparison')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"output_prefix.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"export_comparison_to_csv(results, output_prefix)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"\\\\n生成的文件:\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"for csv_file in output_prefix.parent.glob(f\\\"{output_prefix.name}*.csv\\\"):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"  - {csv_file}\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 8. 可视化比较（可选）\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# 可视化统计结果\\n\",\n",
    "    \"try:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    summary = results['summary']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # 饼图：CDS 匹配情况\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 5))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # 左图：总体匹配情况\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    labels = ['匹配', '仅 antiSMASH', '仅 Prokka']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    sizes = [\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        summary['total_matched'],\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        summary['total_antismash_only'],\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        summary['total_prokka_only']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    colors = ['#2ecc71', '#3498db', '#e74c3c']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax1.pie(sizes, labels=labels, colors=colors, autopct='%1.1f%%', startangle=90)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax1.set_title('CDS 匹配情况', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # 右图：数量对比\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    tools = ['antiSMASH', 'Prokka', '匹配']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    counts = [\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        summary['total_antismash'],\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        summary['total_prokka'],\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        summary['total_matched']\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax2.bar(tools, counts, color=['#3498db', '#e74c3c', '#2ecc71'])\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax2.set_ylabel('CDS 数量', fontsize=12)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax2.set_title('CDS 数量对比', fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ax2.grid(axis='y', alpha=0.3)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # 在柱状图上显示数值\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    for i, v in enumerate(counts):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        ax2.text(i, v + max(counts) * 0.02, str(v), ha='center', va='bottom', fontweight='bold')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    plt.tight_layout()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    plt.savefig('test_output/cds_comparison_plot.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    plt.show()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"✅ 可视化图表已保存到 test_output/cds_comparison_plot.png\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"except ImportError:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"⚠️  需要安装 matplotlib 才能生成可视化图表\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"   安装命令: pip install matplotlib\\\")\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 9. 总结和建议\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 如何解读结果\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"1. **匹配率 > 90%**: 说明两个工具注释结果高度一致\\n\",\n",
    "    \"2. **匹配率 70-90%**: 存在一定差异，需要进一步分析\\n\",\n",
    "    \"3. **匹配率 < 70%**: 差异较大，建议检查输入数据和参数设置\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 常见差异原因\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **最小 CDS 长度**: Prokka 和 antiSMASH 可能使用不同的最小长度阈值\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **基因预测算法**: 两者使用不同的基因查找工具\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **起始密码子选择**: 对于同一基因可能选择不同的起始位置\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **假基因处理**: antiSMASH 更专注于次级代谢产物相关基因\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### 下一步分析\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- 对于不匹配的 CDS，可以手动检查序列\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- 考虑使用第三方工具（如 RAST, PGAP）进行交叉验证\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- 关注特定功能基因（如抗生素合成基因簇）的一致性\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 附录：命令行使用方法\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"除了在 Notebook 中使用，也可以直接在命令行运行比较脚本：\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```bash\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# 比较单个文件\\n\",\n",
    "    \"python compare_cds_annotations.py \\\\\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    --antismash path/to/antismash.gbk \\\\\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    --prokka path/to/prokka.gbk \\\\\\n\",\n",
